  "identifier": "betwixt",
  "description": "Provides a lightweight framework for constructing, reviewing, and documenting candidate semantic claims in tabular data. Candidate claims can be organised into bounded review tasks and presented through configurable human review interfaces. Review decisions, states, and provenance can be recorded while keeping the semantic representation independent of a particular review interface.",
  "name": "betwixt: Scoped Semantic Claims and Human Review Workflows",
